  (text "6161 — Valco 6161-style · Circuit Codex · CC-BY-SA 4.0 · redrawn from circuit facts" (at 24 16 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "50ff19af-c499-4325-b84f-965ae6ebde43"))
  (text "Rails: BP1 reservoir · OT centre tap · 6973 plates — BP2 6973 screens, on their OWN supply node (not tapped on the transformer primary) — B1 preamp and inverter rail. The drawing prints no voltages of any kind." (at 24 21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "e027640e-891a-47ac-b13e-36d17e0d36ec"))
  (text "Heaters, the mains side beyond the transformer (2 A fuse, switch, mains capacitor, line-reverse arrangement), the neon pilot, the input and footswitch jacks and the two 10-inch speakers are omitted here — see netlist.cir, bom.yaml, layout.yaml." (at 24 25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "582bd4e2-5a30-497a-8d44-8773743f17b6"))
  (text "The two stubs lettered A are the sheet's own markers on the two output-grid nodes; they are two separate nodes, not one, and the published redraw of the Supro-badged sibling bridges them with a silencing switch." (at 24 29 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "7dcc6f54-4636-49b9-a4c5-465889b87be4"))
